{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8be80072-b42a-569b-9b77-f4ca432b3fea", "source_ordinal": 1688, "reading_ordinal": 2369, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "面子", "published_at": "2024-03-19T03:29:28+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/648184251/answer/3435446030"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "“丢脸”到底是指什么？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "给丢脸做一个准确的定义——“丢脸”就是个人社会资本的迅速流失。", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "个人的社会资本——也就是声望、信誉、易合作性、低报复性、建设性……等等等等容易转化为优质社会关系的“本钱”——是一个人非常重要的非货币、非实物资产。", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 118}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "那是很大很大的一笔“钱”。尤其是对其他个人资本项下余额不高的年轻人、穷人来说，更是最重要的个人资产，是安身立命、翻盘逆袭的最后保障。", "char_start": 119, "char_end": 185}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因此，越是在高社会性的社群里，“面子”就越是占到个人资产的更大比重。", "char_start": 186, "char_end": 220}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "而资本主义社会——准确的说，市场化的社会——说白了是把很多社会资本货币化了，证券化了，使之成为了不记名，可交易的金融资产。所以导致了个人的主要资产往往是不记名的、已经“液化”（liquified）的社会资本，以所有人都变成了几乎没有社会资本的陌生人、无脸人为代价，换取了所有人都可以更容易的和陌生人交易——你无需那么了解和在意对方的为人处事、社会评价，你只需要了解对方的资产余额、交易押金。数字够大，就可以当信誉用，可以当抵押用。", "char_start": 221, "char_end": 436}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "但这会带来一个直接的影响——人一旦有钱就会自然的发现“匿名无耻”状态比较经济。因为社会已经转型到了只需要查看预付押金余额而不关心其他属性的机制上，因此再费心去维护社会资本也缺少使用场景，就像在精心准备一门不计入高考成绩的科目一样，渐渐的会不受重视。", "char_start": 437, "char_end": 561}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这样，一切不是显性可见的体面（decency）就会被视为不必要的投资。社会成员会与之前相比出现明显的去社会化、反社会化趋势——也就是兽性、兽欲会因为社会化资本的次要化而再次明显起来。而为兽性兽欲辩护的文化投资也很容易从这个新兴市场里得到回报——它们会把这种变化歌颂为“自由”、“解放”，将其去道德化、去罪化，甚至道德化、正义化。", "char_start": 562, "char_end": 726}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这其实就是为什么这个问题会有如此激烈的两极观点的原因。", "char_start": 727, "char_end": 754}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "觉得“丢面子”的一方可以非常明确的感受到这种完全不顾及社会成本的维权方式在迅速的磨损自己的和作为伙伴的对方的社会资本，这让本就在其他资本项下近乎余额为0的自己感到了巨大的焦虑。", "char_start": 755, "char_end": 843}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "然后这种焦虑却会被很多“适应了市场文化”的其他人作激烈的批评。因为ta们认为其实这些负面评价只会由根本不重要的陌生人作出，而真正能作出实质惩罚的权力机关甚至不会对这种不礼貌、有攻击性的行为作出理会和追究。", "char_start": 844, "char_end": 946}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "就算是堵着窗口纠缠食堂大妈又如何呢？食堂能报警吗？警察来了能怎么办？还是学校能因此给个处分？而就算同学和路人为之侧目又如何？ta们能对这行为做出什么惩罚？就算是义愤填膺或者心生鄙夷，只要三天过去，这些观众就会因为缺少身份信息而失去愤怒的具体指向。", "char_start": 947, "char_end": 1070}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "因此，从经济理性的角度来看，顾及体面和社会观感这类“陈腐”的资产项目而回避在可能具体获益项目上投资，就反而成了“不够明智和不够勇敢”。", "char_start": 1071, "char_end": 1138}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "在这个视角下，这个男生唯一的问题只是“经营策略不合理，具体操作成本过高”，而不是“道德有问题，缺少对全局个人利益的综合考量”。", "char_start": 1139, "char_end": 1202}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这个看法对不对，取决于你是否认识到这几个问题：", "char_start": 1203, "char_end": 1226}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "1）高社会化的社会，更有面对挑战的动员和组织能力，能为成员提供显然更为安全、平稳的生存条件。就以新冠挑战为例，很明显从美英为代表的高度自由化的资本主义社会，到日本、台湾这类残余着儒家传统的半资本主义社会，到中国、古巴这类高度社会化的社会主义社会，其应对疫情的能力呈现出鲜明的阶梯差异。", "char_start": 1227, "char_end": 1369}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "其实不止疫情而已，实际上是面对一切宏观的挑战，后者都有更强的应对能力。", "char_start": 1370, "char_end": 1405}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "一旦人类进入某种困难时期，原本在一片繁荣中不会被很好观察到的能力差异就会越来越鲜明。", "char_start": 1406, "char_end": 1448}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "选择将社会资本货币化、证券化是有宏观代价的，认为历史不再会给出足够大的挑战而轻易的付出这个代价、出售社会的社会性换取“经济活跃”，恐怕在长期会被证明是一种对历史的傲慢，对自己主导国际秩序、历史发展的能力的过度自信。", "char_start": 1449, "char_end": 1556}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "2）无论如何，在社会的顶层——决策层、领导层——是不可能忽略人的社会资本的。因为在这一层面，几乎没人是仅仅在凭个人资产余额从事一切活动。论净余额，大部分人反而都是负数，即使不是负数，其经营的项目的总风险也远远大于其个人货币化资产所能担保的水平。", "char_start": 1557, "char_end": 1679}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "一个村长能不能拿个人的资产担保ta做出的政策决策？", "char_start": 1680, "char_end": 1705}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "一个CEO能不能对股东们保证——如果亏了我就用工资和家产包赔？", "char_start": 1706, "char_end": 1737}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "如果你的社会资本为零，或者余额过低，你将失去进入这个阶层、得到最大杠杆的机会。", "char_start": 1738, "char_end": 1777}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这些杠杆可以让你的个人意志在几乎没有货币风险、货币成本的前提下放大几百倍、上千倍，是真正的“社会阶梯”。", "char_start": 1778, "char_end": 1830}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "但这些机会是只会开放给社会资本丰厚的人的。", "char_start": 1831, "char_end": 1852}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "如果你对社会资本的流失不敏感、对保护和经营自己的社会资本没有意识、没有经验，你就注定只能使用纯货币化的杠杆，也就是拿自己的家产抵押，真金白银找银行借钱。", "char_start": 1853, "char_end": 1929}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "同样是实践一个策略构想，村长和CEO们哪怕错了，也往往有“深刻检讨、吸取教训就好”的机会，而你则是稍微赌错就会被强制平仓，瞬间倾家荡产。", "char_start": 1930, "char_end": 1998}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "客观的讲，仗着这个时代提供了这些金融工具、便利交易条件就认为“只依赖货币资本就够了，投资和经营自己的社会资本是多余而过时的经营策略”——也就是“只要钱，不要脸”——是一个非常片面的、甚至是愚蠢的看法。", "char_start": 1999, "char_end": 2099}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "因为这一开始就把自己参与真正能赢的游戏的资格取消了，而且是仅仅为了思想上的安逸、ego上的快感这种其实根本不值钱的廉价快感就抛弃了。", "char_start": 2100, "char_end": 2166}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "约等于为了买游戏机卖掉了苹果的原始股。", "char_start": 2167, "char_end": 2186}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这会影响到择偶、交友上的竞争优势，是显而易见的。", "char_start": 2187, "char_end": 2211}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "如果有得选择，没人会优先选择明显上限较低的人为伍。即使迫不得已只能接受这样的选择，人也会痛恨自己的迫不得已。", "char_start": 2212, "char_end": 2266}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "没人会认为“主张自己的权益”是错误的行为，这甚至都不限于合法的权益，哪怕你主张的是不合法的、超出常规的权益——也就是所谓的贪婪——人也不会仅仅因为你去主张就立刻对你有负面评价。", "char_start": 2268, "char_end": 2356}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "人敏感的是你主张、追求这些权益的时候所采用的手法，是否体现出你对社会规则的精通、对社会利益的强烈直觉、是否有巧妙的、令人敬服的协调的智慧。", "char_start": 2357, "char_end": 2426}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "如果你采用的是简单粗暴、成本高昂、效果不可靠而副作用巨大的策略，哪怕你仅仅伤害的是自己的社会资本，都会被人视为“没活醒的糊涂虫”而纷纷撤销一切和你有关的投资计划。", "char_start": 2427, "char_end": 2508}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "何况是在你身上投资最大的恋人、配偶呢？", "char_start": 2509, "char_end": 2528}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "如果你不但不警醒、还要抱怨甚至用辱骂来惩罚对方的撤资冲动，你至少不应该对合作关系能继续持续抱有不切实际的幻想。", "char_start": 2529, "char_end": 2584}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "抱有这样的幻想，人家只会撤得更快。", "char_start": 2585, "char_end": 2602}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 39}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0349"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：男朋友为了三块钱在学校餐厅和食堂大妈理论，为什么我觉得很丢脸？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038"], "summary": "围绕“面子”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：““丢脸”到底是指什么？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "“丢脸”到底是指什么？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "c1380a6f-707f-504f-a104-d2ee12400caf", "source_ordinal": 1687, "reading_ordinal": 2370, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "典守者难辞其咎", "published_at": "2024-03-19T06:07:25+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/648698764/answer/3435466472"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有必要仔细调查班主任、学校、学生群体对此的知情程度。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "如果学生普遍知情而班主任、校方不知情，或者知情但没有有效干预，都要承担监管责任，承受相应的处罚。", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 75}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这个处罚要严厉到对同样的不作为有震慑作用。", "char_start": 76, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "可以允许你对偶发的、短暂的霸凌现象不知情——毕竟老师不是天眼通；", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 130}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "可以允许你班上出现霸凌现象——毕竟老师不是定律之神；", "char_start": 131, "char_end": 157}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "也可以允许你处理了但仍然没有完全防止意外——毕竟老师不是超人。", "char_start": 158, "char_end": 189}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "但是不能允许你对长期存在的、学生普遍知情的、最后导致严重后果的霸凌毫不知情或者知情后没有任何记录在案和通报给家长的处理记录。", "char_start": 190, "char_end": 252}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这不属于“过度苛求教育工作者”，这仅仅只是要求学校承担它本来就该承担的社会安全网职责。", "char_start": 253, "char_end": 296}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这件事里学校责任如果不得到严肃追究，实际上对后续防止这类现象没有多少实质帮助。", "char_start": 297, "char_end": 336}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为反社会人格是自然随机发生的，你就是把这几个凶手判了死刑，也无法减少同样无知而有天然人格发育缺陷的青少年继续发作。", "char_start": 337, "char_end": 395}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "某种意义上这是一种基因突变性质的精神疾病，试图仅靠判刑解决就像打算靠判刑防治先天性心脏病。（这不妨碍将严重罪行适用范围下调很有必要）", "char_start": 396, "char_end": 462}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这类随机自发发生的凶残霸凌现象如果没有学校的严密监控，全靠课外才会和子女接触的父母——尤其是还有大量根本没有得到父母有效监护的留守儿童——是效果很差的。", "char_start": 463, "char_end": 539}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "在这事件涉及到的一切因素中，促进学校做出改进是最有效的投资。", "char_start": 540, "char_end": 570}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "希望公众不要模糊了焦点，错误的把注意力全都投放到了如何“复仇”上——真正重要的是如何降低同类事情的再现概率，而不是安抚公众情绪。", "char_start": 571, "char_end": 635}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "事实上，能有效降低概率的措施，才能真正的安抚住公众的焦虑情绪。", "char_start": 636, "char_end": 667}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0349"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：河北邯郸13岁初中男生遭3名同班同学杀害并掩埋，3同学家长至今未道歉，两家已人去楼空，对此怎么看呢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“典守者难辞其咎”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有必要仔细调查班主任、学校、学生群体对此的知情程度。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有必要仔细调查班主任、学校、学生群体对此的知情程度。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "51415d99-86d0-5431-864e-4afffb3195b5", "source_ordinal": 1686, "reading_ordinal": 2371, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "祖坟青烟", "published_at": "2024-03-19T17:50:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/455513991/answer/3436241104"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个可得好好感谢美国，因为美国扎扎实实的帮中国机床创造了一个理想而又饥渴的独家市场——俄罗斯。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "1.4亿人口的传统工业国家，正在渴望全面的提升工业产能，这还不是慢慢做，而是在打仗，而且所有比你强的对手全都不准卖给它、只能找你买，并且会极为积极的提供使用反馈，并且有硬通货的支付能力。", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 141}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这种全面成体系的换装，而且还是跨国贸易，对机床行业的意义非常重大——因为它势必会在需求中催生出经过千锤百炼的新工业标准和配套体系，惯性非常巨大。", "char_start": 142, "char_end": 214}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "看似俄企是买了一批设备，实际上这几乎意味着之后所有的升级服务、维护服务、改造服务、设备换装——尤其是成套设备、整流水线方案这类——都已经买了你家的。", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 289}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "未来就算是公开竞标、你原厂出的方案只要不是杀鸡取卵式的搞法，几乎都必胜。", "char_start": 290, "char_end": 326}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这机会甚至比这些企业在国内的业务都更有价值。光在国内搞搞“等位进口替代”都是不够的，和成系列的全套出口意义不同。", "char_start": 327, "char_end": 383}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这个关键机会，很可能导致中国机床成长成日本、德国的严重威胁，顺带严重打击台湾、瑞典这些为德日美系生产线搞专项配套的对手。", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 444}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "更不必说中国的汽车产业大爆发还有另一波机会。", "char_start": 445, "char_end": 467}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "如果我们的机床成功的满足了俄罗斯的工业化需求，那么这些系列产品就将非常好的支撑中国企业全球布局的需求，我们可以轻易的大幅提升友好国家的工业实力，进一步放大第三世界阵营的总体竞争力，把西方集团的一大财源挤出受害的殖民地。", "char_start": 468, "char_end": 577}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这都是直接挖树根的狠活，可不是什么加点减点关税这个级别的过家家。", "char_start": 578, "char_end": 610}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这种神奇到好笑的好机会，真是祖坟冒青烟。", "char_start": 611, "char_end": 631}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0349"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：中国机床在国际上大概的地位是什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“祖坟青烟”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个可得好好感谢美国，因为美国扎扎实实的帮中国机床创造了一个理想而又饥渴的独家市场——俄罗斯。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个可得好好感谢美国，因为美国扎扎实实的帮中国机床创造了一个理想而又饥渴的独家市场——俄罗斯。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 47, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "805b8335-6e05-5809-84cf-cd3da931733d", "source_ordinal": 1685, "reading_ordinal": 2372, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "最佳徒手圆", "published_at": "2024-03-20T19:42:34+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/648374618/answer/3437567538"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "不要相信任何“潇洒”的“甩狙”法，至少其直径不受控。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "画圆的最佳方法，包括透视圆。", "char_start": 28, "char_end": 42}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "用圆弧线依次连接", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 52}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "0, 2", "char_start": 53, "char_end": 57}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "1, 3.75", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "2, 4", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 70}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "3, 3.75", "char_start": 71, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "4, 2", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "……", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "即可得到半径为2的圆。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "非整数坐标可用1x4矩形对角线与第2横断线的交点求得。", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 126}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "原理：", "char_start": 127, "char_end": 130}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "坐标2, 2到坐标 1, 3.75）的距离为 sqrt(1x1 + 1.75x1.75) = sqrt（4.0625）= 2.0155，", "char_start": 131, "char_end": 199}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "半径误差为0.0155/2 = 0.00775。", "char_start": 200, "char_end": 224}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "A4纸宽度为21cm，此法理论误差为210x0.00775= 1.6275mm，与你的线宽度相当。", "char_start": 225, "char_end": 274}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "记住，重要的不是“潇洒”，而是出手必中、无需技巧。", "char_start": 275, "char_end": 300}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2024-03/20/4d237ea8b8c30f825351d861017e5a79.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18, "image": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0349"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：你能用徒手画出一个多么极致的圆？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“最佳徒手圆”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“不要相信任何“潇洒”的“甩狙”法，至少其直径不受控。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "不要相信任何“潇洒”的“甩狙”法，至少其直径不受控。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "829ecdfc-075f-58de-9f00-1ff2ff4bb599", "source_ordinal": 1684, "reading_ordinal": 2373, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "富国plus", "published_at": "2024-03-21T07:54:34+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/649232756/answer/3437952073"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "没什么值得关注的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "中国基本上是一个3、4亿人口的发达地区和一个10亿人口的发展中地区的嵌合体。这四亿人口的生活水平、财产，其实都和日美欧基本相当了。", "char_start": 10, "char_end": 75}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "其中有13.3万户1300万美元资产、208万户130万美元资产的家庭没有任何值得大惊小怪的地方。", "char_start": 76, "char_end": 125}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "接着把剩下的十亿人口收入和生活水平尽快提升就好了。", "char_start": 126, "char_end": 151}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "注意，中国的社会财富的大头不在这些家庭资产中。别的不谈，这所谓的“富豪家庭”有几个拥有几千英亩的土地？有几个拥有私人海滩、私人岛屿？有几个拥有钢铁厂、发电厂？拥有铁路线？拥有波音、洛马、雷神？", "char_start": 152, "char_end": 248}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "绝大多数不过是拥有两三套比较值钱的住房、数千人的企业的股权而已。", "char_start": 249, "char_end": 281}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "中国真正富有的是国库，大多数投资都投在了国土建设上。", "char_start": 282, "char_end": 308}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "看似这些“贫富差距很大”，其实如果你把国家的公共资产平分到每个人名下再看，就会得到完全不同的结论。", "char_start": 309, "char_end": 358}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "真要把全部国有资产瓜分掉，平均每家少说也可以分个百把万。", "char_start": 359, "char_end": 387}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "然后再算贫富差距，那个倍数值立刻就掉下去了。", "char_start": 388, "char_end": 410}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "虽然不能说美日欧没有国有资产，但是它们的国有资产是远不如我们的占比大的。", "char_start": 411, "char_end": 447}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "它们也花掉了大笔的税收收入，但是这些收入基本上都用在了费用性的项目上，并没有形成多少公共财富。", "char_start": 448, "char_end": 495}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "别的不谈，光是所谓的阿富汗战争就烧了2.26万亿。两次伊拉克战争呢？乌克兰又花了美国1130亿。", "char_start": 496, "char_end": 544}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "现在一年8、9千亿养着美军，5400亿医疗预算，这都是美元，不是人民币。", "char_start": 545, "char_end": 581}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这还没算欧洲。", "char_start": 582, "char_end": 589}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "政府一穷二白、公共财富几乎枯竭的私有制国家，和公共财富雄厚无比的全民所有制国家，即使在“家庭财产两极化”上的数据看上去“接近”，实际上的本质却差得远了去了。", "char_start": 590, "char_end": 668}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "要不是美国可以印钱输出通胀，ta们连跟我们比较的资格都没有。", "char_start": 669, "char_end": 699}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "自己算算就知道了。", "char_start": 700, "char_end": 709}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0349"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：胡润报告称中国千万资产家庭达 208 万户，拥有亿元资产的家庭达 13.3 万户，哪些信息值得关注？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“富国plus”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“没什么值得关注的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "没什么值得关注的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "40ebfaaf-9fac-5f2a-8fa0-ea161ea34d8d", "source_ordinal": 1683, "reading_ordinal": 2374, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "行业纵览", "published_at": "2024-03-21T08:53:13+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/451199603/answer/3438010170"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "具体怎么样，最好自己找到方法去看一看。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "最好的方法，就是养成习惯，多参加一些国内的贸易博览会。", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "上海、广州几乎每周都有不同主题的展会——比如现在广州就在搞世界家具博览会。", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "有时甚至一周几个展。", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 96}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你可以关注一下上海新国际博览中心、国家会展中心、广交会展馆的公众号。", "char_start": 97, "char_end": 131}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你如果真的关心中国的国力，又没条件神州走透透，大可以盯着这几个展馆，看到关心的主题就去看看。", "char_start": 132, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这些展大多数都只需要预约，基本都是不收费的。而且很能体现不同领域的行业普遍水平。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 219}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "眼见为实，你还可以直接跟厂商聊一下，保证热情周到，你不懂人家都可以给你扫盲。而且在这里你才看得到这些东西的出厂价。", "char_start": 220, "char_end": 277}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你看完出厂价，你就知道我们的制造业是不是天下无敌了——以这个品质、产能、信誉，我们的价格就是人类文明的奇迹。", "char_start": 278, "char_end": 332}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "绝对比在知乎听人唱各种调子有决定性。", "char_start": 333, "char_end": 351}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "Tips：", "char_start": 353, "char_end": 358}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "1）有条件带上电动轮椅或者平衡车，绝对不要穿高跟鞋。", "char_start": 359, "char_end": 385}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "2）教你个绝招——很多摊位都会懒得把样品运回家，越接近撤展价钱越低，最后几乎给钱就卖。", "char_start": 386, "char_end": 429}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "扫一些新奇特的回去挂闲鱼，你一天的饭钱都有了。送朋友也是个玩意儿啊。", "char_start": 430, "char_end": 464}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "3）实际上，就算你不关心中国的产业发展，纯从个人娱乐角度，这些博览会也要比大多数旅游好玩。", "char_start": 465, "char_end": 510}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "尤其是身边亲戚子侄有脑子不清醒，中了认知战神经毒剂的，到这里可以自动排毒醒脑。", "char_start": 511, "char_end": 550}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "小孩初中以上就可以定期带去，绝对比迪斯尼乐园、冰雪大世界有教育意义。", "char_start": 551, "char_end": 585}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0349"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：中国制造业真的已经全球领先了吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“行业纵览”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“具体怎么样，最好自己找到方法去看一看。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "具体怎么样，最好自己找到方法去看一看。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "02485817-7730-5b5d-94d6-b434b6f5e681", "source_ordinal": 1682, "reading_ordinal": 2375, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "金钱爆", "published_at": "2024-03-22T12:07:30+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/646993405/answer/3439468988"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "任何时候，都不要自己把自己当成任何人活着的念想，即使当事人这么说也不要在意。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "只有上帝可以、应该承担“当念想”这种责任，人是没有权利去指定某个人类来承担这种责任的。", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "哪怕是指望自己也不行，哪怕被指望的人自己愿意也不行。因为一旦承担这种责任，人就要负责给指望的人安排恰当的命运，也就意味着一旦接受这种指派，从那一刻起对方所有的不幸你都要负责。", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 170}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你拿什么来负责？赔钱吗？对方说因为你没考上大学，该赔多少？说因为你进了精神病院，该赔多少？", "char_start": 171, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这东西只有一种例外，那就是这个责任本来就是上天指定的——例如亲生父母对未成年子女承担这个责任，例如国家指定的负责人对孤儿承担这个责任。", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 284}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但在这种情况下，你对自己的命运不满，真正要负责的是做出这个安排的上天和国家，不是这个责任人本身。责任人本身只就自己的失职去面对上天 / 国家的处罚，而不是去向你赔偿。", "char_start": 285, "char_end": 368}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "除了这种特殊情况之外，人没有权利指定别人为自己的“指望”，去把命运的责任强加到任何人身上。", "char_start": 369, "char_end": 414}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "否则别的不谈，你要把这么大的责任压在别人肩上，你准备给多大的酬劳？还是说你根本没想过给人家什么酬劳，还觉得指定别人当自己的“念想”对对方是一种赏脸、一种恩赐？恨不得对方还要感激一下、酬谢一下？还倒欠你一份应该拿一生来偿还的感谢？", "char_start": 415, "char_end": 529}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这道理说得过去吗？", "char_start": 530, "char_end": 539}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你要真有这个打算，就应该拿着“做指望”的完整合约来谈，看我能不能接受这个报价来做你的指望，这才是基于自愿建立的有效关系。", "char_start": 540, "char_end": 600}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你为什么不走这个程序？因为你发现它根本没法走通，一旦涉及到给对方报酬，你就根本负担不起，不是吗？", "char_start": 601, "char_end": 649}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "下次有人跟你说这话，你就直接问ta“准备付多少钱一小时，我考虑一下”。", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 686}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "注意，不要问“要是我同意的话你准备给我什么报酬”，因为对方很容易话赶话回答“那我给你一生的感激和全部的忠诚”。这样说你就不好办了，因为这就涉及到人格的尊严和生命的价值了，你不能说人家的人格和生命不够值钱。", "char_start": 687, "char_end": 789}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "所以你直接“现实”一点，直接问“做你的指望多少钱一小时，几点下班，有没有双休和五险一金，具体要干些啥”。", "char_start": 790, "char_end": 842}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "就事论事，讨价还价，童叟无欺。", "char_start": 843, "char_end": 858}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "要真是那种“只需要静静的坐着让我每天远远的看一眼就好”然后“一眼120元，现金支付”的活，真的可以考虑接一接。", "char_start": 859, "char_end": 914}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "在商言商，大家直接谈钱就好了。你看，你都不需要付出“一生的感激和全部的忠诚”，只需要付出120块就可以立刻“指望”一次，这多划算。", "char_start": 915, "char_end": 980}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这可对你是大减价，惊喜不？", "char_start": 981, "char_end": 994}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你为啥不接受？", "char_start": 995, "char_end": 1002}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "真奇怪。", "char_start": 1003, "char_end": 1007}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0349"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：一个喜欢我的男生说自己有抑郁倾向，叫我给个念想他，不然不知道在学校有什么意义了，我怎么办啊  ？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“金钱爆”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“任何时候，都不要自己把自己当成任何人活着的念想，即使当事人这么说也不要在意。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "任何时候，都不要自己把自己当成任何人活着的念想，即使当事人这么说也不要在意。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "03bd80d4-ec7c-5f58-ab43-8a884283dd2d", "source_ordinal": 1681, "reading_ordinal": 2376, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "没用的眼泪", "published_at": "2024-03-23T02:34:58+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/649323741/answer/3440239945"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你妈也是二十好几才开始算得上“有用”，你打算有多快？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "从“无用”到“有用”，一共有多少关要过？事实上，唐僧西天取经都不见得比一个人做到“有用”难。", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "又要学通基础知识，又要掌握技能，又要通晓和人沟通和相处，还要理解和驯服自己的兽性，还要经历无数的意外、挫折的折磨和考验。", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "在这之前，一切所谓的“成功”都主要是出于幸运、出于别人的周全和不计较，只不过是成色不足的偶然而已。", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 184}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "不要为了小孩子哭喊什么“没用”就去胡编一堆“不啊你如何如何很有用啊”去“开导”ta们。", "char_start": 185, "char_end": 228}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "因为你这样一“开导”，很快就会面对新的逻辑困境，那就是“这个程度的‘有用’又有什么用”。", "char_start": 229, "char_end": 273}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "不错，如此浅薄脆弱、结果不可靠的夸张、安慰出来的“有用”，真的一上阵就知道其实不顶用。最后的净结果只是你的信用破产了，用在一次无意义的延迟宣判的申请上了。", "char_start": 274, "char_end": 351}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "没用就是没用，有用是要几十年来练出来的，你现在没用就是题中应有之义。", "char_start": 352, "char_end": 386}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "不然你为啥需要学习十几年？", "char_start": 387, "char_end": 400}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "别说你，我是你爹妈，我都还在向“毫无疑问有用”的方向追求好吗。", "char_start": 401, "char_end": 432}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "毫无疑问的有用，意味着在财务上获得绝对保障，意味着获客成本为零——意味着只要有眼睛的人就知道这盘菜你来炒一定不难吃、吃了一定不拉肚子。", "char_start": 433, "char_end": 500}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "意味着对人只剩下“请你的工资是否划算”的问题，不存在“请了你这活能不能干得了”的问题。", "char_start": 501, "char_end": 544}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "意味着只要你要求不过分，你一定可以有立足之地，甚至哪怕你的要求有些过分也未必没有一定的运气得逞。", "char_start": 545, "char_end": 593}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这不是儿童的起点，而是少年的终点。", "char_start": 594, "char_end": 611}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你今年几岁？你没用纯属正常状态。", "char_start": 612, "char_end": 628}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你居然还为“没用”哭泣，找打啊你？", "char_start": 629, "char_end": 646}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "至于那些觉得“有用”的标准很低，以至于对“没用”的人——尤其是未成年人——不屑一顾的人，说实话都是些不幸只在缺少挑战的稳定环境里做过比较简单的事情的可怜人。", "char_start": 648, "char_end": 726}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "那个环境动荡一下、或者难度要求被提升一级，ta们才会真的知道“有用”到底是什么标准。", "char_start": 727, "char_end": 769}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "ta们那个出于阅历缺陷而过度压低的标准不值得考虑。", "char_start": 770, "char_end": 795}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 20}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0349"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：当6岁的男孩儿对我说“妈妈我觉得我没有用”时，我该怎么开导他？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“没用的眼泪”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你妈也是二十好几才开始算得上“有用”，你打算有多快？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你妈也是二十好几才开始算得上“有用”，你打算有多快？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
